<h2 id="spaces-descent-section-syntomic-local-source" class="tex-section"><span data-tag="06EZ">74.17</span> Properties of morphisms local in the syntomic topology on the source</h2>

<p>
Here are some properties of morphisms that are syntomic local on the source. 
</p>
<p>
<article class="env-lemma" id="06F0">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06F0">Lemma <span data-tag="06F0">74.17.1</span>.</a> The property $\mathcal{P}(f)=$“$f$ is syntomic” is syntomic local on the source. </p>
</article> 
</p>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/06ER" data-tag="06ER">74.14.3</a> using Morphisms of Spaces, Definition <a href="/tag/03Z7" data-tag="03Z7">67.36.1</a> and Descent, Lemma <a href="/tag/036S" data-tag="036S">35.29.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>
